        "nobel_worthiness": "Interfaces that coherently connect light and matter enabled quantum memories and network nodes, opening a major experimental direction in quantum information.",
        "attribution": "Rempe, Kimble, and Lukin led distinctive approaches to cavity interfaces, atom-photon coupling, and memory and network concepts.",
        "maturity": "Core operations are well demonstrated, though large, reliable quantum networks remain an active engineering and physics challenge.",
        "uncertainties": [
