        "nobel_worthiness": "Baryon acoustic oscillations provide a robust standard ruler for measuring cosmic expansion and have become a central probe of cosmology.",
        "attribution": "These names capture influential theory and landmark survey analyses, though the result depended on broad teams and successive generations of surveys.",
        "maturity": "The signal has been measured across large surveys and redshifts, with independent confirmation and continuing cosmological use.",
