        "attribution": "Gabrielse and Hangst led distinct, complementary approaches to precision studies of antiprotons and antihydrogen.",
        "maturity": "Antihydrogen production and increasingly precise measurements are established, though the most discriminating symmetry tests are still improving.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "No decisive departure from established particle physics has emerged, and the discovery claim is less singular than a new effect."
