        "attribution": "Falcke helped frame the imaging target, Doeleman led the observational effort, and Moran contributed foundational very-long-baseline interferometry work.",
        "maturity": "The initial image has been followed by independent imaging of another black hole and additional analyses, although the observational record remains comparatively young.",
